1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 23=

15
00:01:10,870 --> 00:01:11,310
Hurry!

16
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,310
Hurry!

17
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:18,690
Back then, Third Prince
put an end to the war,

18
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:19,820
earning glory that will last
for generations.

19
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,280
His Majesty personally inscribed

20
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,920
the four words "Glory for All Eternity."

21
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,430
Back then,

22
00:01:23,430 --> 00:01:24,380
Marquis Jingyuan made
a disastrous decision,

23
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:25,740
costing tens of thousands
of elite soldiers their lives.

24
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:27,230
If Third Prince
hadn't turned the tide,

25
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,080
we would've been...

26
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,640
The difference between them

27
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,360
couldn't be greater.

28
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,030
Look, here he comes!

29
00:01:33,710 --> 00:01:35,430
- Long live Your Highness!
- Long live Your Highness!

30
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,560
- Long live Your Highness!
- Long live Your Highness!

31
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,560
- Long live Your Highness!
- Long live Your Highness!

32
00:01:41,790 --> 00:01:43,360
(Shen Cheng has no solid evidence,)

33
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:44,840
(but his accusations)

34
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,230
(have made Father suspicious.)

35
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,840
(Fortunately, I had
this shrine built first.)

36
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:50,040
(Once Father sees)

37
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,950
(how much the people support me,)

38
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:53,430
(how could he possibly)

39
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,230
(choose anyone else as Crown Prince?)

40
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:01,840
Your Highness.

41
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:03,280
Just as you predicted.

42
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:05,310
Today, those two women
from the Marquis's Manor

43
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,430
tried to sneak away with the dancing girl.

44
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,490
Our men intercepted them in the forest

45
00:02:08,490 --> 00:02:09,330
and shot them dead on the spot.

46
00:02:21,150 --> 00:02:22,600
Third Prince anticipated
your every move.

47
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:24,110
He knew you'd come this way today.

48
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,270
Come with us quietly,

49
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:27,990
and we'll leave your bodies intact.

50
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,360
(The dancing girl is dead.)

51
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:36,920
(There are no witnesses left.)

52
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:39,870
(Whatever testimony
the Shen brothers present,)

53
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:40,990
(it will be useless.)

54
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,230
Once the ceremony is over,

55
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:46,950
gather the incense offerings

56
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:48,550
and distribute them among
the city's beggars.

57
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,920
Have them keep spreading word
of my achievements.

58
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,470
The farther it spreads, the better.

59
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:53,880
Yes.

60
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,110
(So this is all it takes)

61
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:00,550
(to win the people's support.)

62
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,800
(With this shrine completed,)

63
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,510
(everyone will know)

64
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,670
(who truly has the makings
of a wise ruler.)

65
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:07,880
(Father,)

66
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,600
(who else but me)

67
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,640
(could possibly deserve)

68
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:12,760
(the position of Crown Prince?)

69
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,670
The auspicious hour has arrived.

70
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,390
Third Prince will now unveil the shrine.

71
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,760
- Wonderful!
- Wonderful!

72
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,200
Wonderful!

73
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:39,480
The people truly support him.

74
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,550
- Wait!
- Wait!

75
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,040
Who's that?

76
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:03,480
Third Prince.

77
00:04:04,310 --> 00:04:05,390
You murdered fellow officers,

78
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:06,600
poisoned innocent dancing girls,

79
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:08,150
falsified military achievements,

80
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:09,080
and deceived His Majesty.

81
00:04:09,590 --> 00:04:10,600
After committing such crimes,

82
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:12,830
how dare you accept
the people's worship?

83
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,710
Who are those two?

84
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,120
How dare they slander the Third Prince?

85
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:22,800
Shen Cheng.

86
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:24,830
What makes you say such things?

87
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,680
I was ordered to quell the rebellion

88
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,000
and defend our borders.

89
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,760
This shrine

90
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:33,080
was bestowed upon me by His Majesty.

91
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,270
It was your father,

92
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,710
Marquis Jingyuan,

93
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:40,350
who disobeyed military orders,

94
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,440
causing tens of thousands
of soldiers to die.

95
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,910
So that's what happened.

96
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,590
Why wasn't his entire family executed?

97
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,200
You two brothers

98
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,830
should be grateful
I pleaded with His Majesty

99
00:04:49,830 --> 00:04:51,150
to spare your family
and the Marquis's Manor.

100
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:54,120
Yet you dare disrupt
this dedication ceremony.

101
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,640
Your parents were disgraced generals.

102
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:56,910
And their sons?

103
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,950
One is a petty schemer,

104
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:01,030
the other a reckless idler.

105
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,190
Both are equally ungrateful,

106
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,150
with no sense of gratitude or decency.

107
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,590
I suspect you've come here today

108
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,320
with treasonous intentions.

109
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:11,910
Arrest them!

110
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,590
I'd like to see who dares touch them.

111
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,320
Who's that?

112
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:26,880
Who's this person?

113
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:28,100
I don't recognize her.

114
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,590
Who is she?

115
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,470
He's no petty schemer.

116
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,760
All these years,

117
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,080
he's carried the burden
of his parents' wrongful conviction,

118
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,200
held the Marquis's Manor together,

119
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,080
and protected his younger brother.

120
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,040
He's the most responsible man

121
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,030
I've ever known.

122
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,680
Someone like you

123
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,830
isn't even worthy of serving him.

124
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,510
And he's no reckless idler.

125
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:07,120
He studied to become a coroner
to uncover the truth,

126
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,910
even though he knew
people would ridicule him.

127
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,510
He has far more courage

128
00:06:12,090 --> 00:06:13,450
than someone like you
who retreats without fighting.

129
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:15,390
How can you two still be alive?

130
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,950
Your Highness,

131
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:17,880
that's not a very clever thing to say.

132
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,880
Everyone you thought was dead

133
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,270
has shown up today.

134
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,760
Surprised?
Didn't see that coming, did you?

135
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,270
Sanqi, Cangzhu.

136
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,430
We'll leave things here to you.

137
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:53,080
Spread the word
that we faked our deaths.

138
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,880
Let the Third Prince enjoy
his moment of triumph.

139
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,850
Rest assured, Your Ladyship.

140
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:56,760
We'll take care of things here.

141
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,470
Let's go.

142
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,240
Head to the shrine.

143
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,800
You tricked me!

144
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,200
All's fair in war.

145
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,950
If Your Highness doesn't even know that,

146
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,640
how can you command an army?

147
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,320
Oh.

148
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,240
I almost forgot.

149
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:14,710
Your military achievements

150
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,710
were fabricated in the first place.

151
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:19,200
You think you can slander me
with baseless accusations?

152
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,030
Aren't you afraid

153
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,830
I'll charge you with defaming a prince?

154
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:22,760
Five years ago,

155
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,600
you forcibly abducted

156
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,910
fifteen dancing girls
from Wangyue Pavilion.

157
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,830
You planned to poison them

158
00:07:27,830 --> 00:07:28,880
and send them to the enemy.

159
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:31,770
My parents couldn't stand by
while you killed innocent people,

160
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:32,510
so they tried to stop you.

161
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:33,560
That's why you had them murdered.

162
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,270
Then you falsely accused them

163
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,560
of disobeying military orders.

164
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,390
Did that really happen?

165
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:40,710
And he still had the nerve
to build a shrine?

166
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,100
I heard there were accusations
back then.

167
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,370
I thought people were just jealous
of the Third Prince.

168
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,360
So they were true.

169
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,510
Of the fifteen dancing girls,

170
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,680
only seven survived.

171
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,200
Afraid the truth would come out,

172
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:51,680
you sent men to hunt them down.

173
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:52,880
But what you didn't know

174
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,830
(Postmortem Report)
is that I studied to become a coroner

175
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:57,800
precisely

176
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:00,080
to give the dead a voice.

177
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,310
Every single thing

178
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:03,000
you did to those women

179
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,950
left traces on their bodies.

180
00:08:07,430 --> 00:08:08,270
And those traces

181
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,240
are evidence of your crimes.

182
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:13,950
Looks like the Third Prince

183
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,070
won't be able to deny it this time.

184
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:15,590
Exactly.

185
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,080
Now things are getting interesting.

186
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:20,880
All this talk of postmortem findings

187
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,590
is nothing but fabrication.

188
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,030
How does that count as evidence?

189
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,270
You think a worthless piece
of paper can bring me down?

190
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,560
Dream on.

191
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,800
Still refusing to admit it?

192
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,320
You really won't admit defeat
until you see the proof.

193
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:34,520
In that case,

194
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,870
today,

195
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,800
you'll get exactly
the proof you asked for.

196
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,630
Third Prince.

197
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,400
It's been years.

198
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,630
Yue once said

199
00:09:02,150 --> 00:09:03,560
that everything you've done

200
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,080
would one day

201
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,080
earn you the contempt
of the whole world.

202
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,120
I am the only surviving

203
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,950
dancing girl from Wangyue Pavilion.

204
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:18,230
I'm also the only witness alive

205
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,740
who knows the truth

206
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,920
about Qiyun Pass.

207
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,630
The Marquis and his wife

208
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:24,680
never disobeyed military orders.

209
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,750
They were protecting us

210
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:29,440
when the Third Prince
stabbed them to death.

211
00:09:29,930 --> 00:09:31,010
Killing a general
without cause during battle

212
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,110
is tantamount to treason!

213
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,470
Well, look at that.

214
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,140
They might as well turn his shrine
into a memorial for the dead.

215
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,670
This is a testimony written in blood

216
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:39,990
by all the women who suffered.

217
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:44,440
Every stroke

218
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:47,400
is evidence of your crimes.

219
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:52,110
The Third Prince you're honoring today

220
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,400
has the blood

221
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,680
of all my sisters on his hands,

222
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:56,710
as well as

223
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:59,920
the blood
of Marquis Jingyuan and his wife,

224
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:03,440
and that of soldiers across the land!

225
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:07,380
She's spreading lies
to deceive the people!

226
00:10:08,910 --> 00:10:09,990
She's spreading lies
to deceive the people!

227
00:10:12,150 --> 00:10:13,990
You call the words of a brothel woman

228
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:15,560
evidence?

229
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,950
Fabricating evidence

230
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,590
and slandering a prince!

231
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:23,990
Guards!

232
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,230
Arrest them all!

233
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:27,270
An imperial decree has arrived!

234
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:27,750
Too late.

235
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:30,150
His Majesty already knows

236
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:31,920
the whole truth about Qiyun Pass.

237
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,230
By the Mandate of Heaven,

238
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:48,830
His Majesty decrees.

239
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:51,350
The Third Prince
fabricated military achievements,

240
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,800
poisoned innocent people,

241
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,350
and framed loyal subjects.

242
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:55,870
His crimes are unforgivable.

243
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,510
Effective immediately,

244
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,750
he shall be stripped of his title

245
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,160
and imprisoned in the imperial prison.

246
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:03,870
Why?

247
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,440
Sisters...

248
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,200
- Good!
- Good!

249
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:08,550
No!

250
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:10,110
Do you see this?

251
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,270
- Good!
- Good!

252
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,470
- Sisters...
- Good! He deserves it!

253
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:14,040
The truth

254
00:11:15,450 --> 00:11:17,040
has finally come to light.

255
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,280
Mother.

256
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,350
Father.

257
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,560
The man who murdered you

258
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:29,200
has finally received
the punishment he deserves.

259
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:45,950
Father.

260
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,320
Mother.

261
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,400
We did it.

262
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,560
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

263
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:19,760
♪Right now, I just want
to stay by your side♪

264
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:24,960
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

265
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:31,200
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

266
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:37,640
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

267
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:44,120
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

268
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:48,760
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

269
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:10,880
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

